the row's purpose, that every live row is registered and none is dropped or added unrecorded, is preserved
rather than relaxed. I confirmed the seven are the acceptance rows and not a re-count of existing ones: rows
31-37 of run.test.ts, all new in this opus, all ran unskipped both here and in the receipt's gate cell.

